{"article_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Aspect_ratio", "attribution": "Mozilla Contributors", "doc_id": "mdn:en:glossary/aspect_ratio", "excerpt_sha256": "55ac4bc1a13ce94b89353bbe1e0522d00e4573b4b1e8c562aadac5127aee6a66", "family_id": "mdn:glossary/aspect_ratio", "language": "en", "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.5", "source_byte": [294, 578], "source_sha256": "66658eb3dabbdbc1d4cadf5288e1cae6500e9946ec63bfe604861f4183a39838", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdn/content/05b21c9303964f221febe77f053e5636f230afe9/files/en-us/glossary/aspect_ratio/index.md", "split": "train", "text": "Having an aspect ratio, whether it's an inherent aspect ratio like with images and videos or if it's extrinsically set, maintains the intended proportions of an element. You can also query an element or viewport's aspect, which is useful in developing flexible components and layouts.", "title": "Aspect ratio"}
{"article_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Glossary/Aspect_ratio", "attribution": "Mozilla Contributors", "doc_id": "mdn:zh:glossary/aspect_ratio", "excerpt_sha256": "56708cae3b724595c8a69799894e1a2de6783a9c7338c6b9ae024b6b15a054a1", "family_id": "mdn:glossary/aspect_ratio", "language": "zh", "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.5", "source_byte": [259, 493], "source_sha256": "538cf813f79f040bbf4e2ce5c743a7c90da562d526ad0e99073da9d7ea93331c", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdn/translated-content/79c5df5882bc51786844b8fa72a06a80a24f6404/files/zh-cn/glossary/aspect_ratio/index.md", "split": "train", "text": "拥有纵横比，无论是像图片和视频这样的固有纵横比，还是外部设置的，都能保持元素的预期比例。你还可以查询元素或视口的纵横比，这对于开发灵活的组件和布局非常有用。", "title": "纵横比"}
{"article_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Bandwidth", "attribution": "Mozilla Contributors", "doc_id": "mdn:en:glossary/bandwidth", "excerpt_sha256": "941ec1c4907d109f284f60634419e7b909d7a7d77310cbacb46726b6749834d5", "family_id": "mdn:glossary/bandwidth", "language": "en", "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.5", "source_byte": [222, 353], "source_sha256": "24b7b68be17c49fd787dd4d0bb07c03e4eeb8cc8f238b2ae719d8c1303482dec", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdn/content/05b21c9303964f221febe77f053e5636f230afe9/files/en-us/glossary/bandwidth/index.md", "split": "train", "text": "It is usually measured in multiples of bits-per-second (bps), for example megabits-per-second (Mbps) or gigabits-per-second (Gbps).", "title": "Bandwidth"}
{"article_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Glossary/Bandwidth", "attribution": "Mozilla Contributors", "doc_id": "mdn:zh:glossary/bandwidth", "excerpt_sha256": "16b8228f402ec409308830ad7302385e744012f726e5df074070dbd32fb890f6", "family_id": "mdn:glossary/bandwidth", "language": "zh", "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.5", "source_byte": [204, 317], "source_sha256": "1fbf5c50cd2536da4adf5d3e736f4d28d985abe3e962fc5b052c4b5949c1477e", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdn/translated-content/79c5df5882bc51786844b8fa72a06a80a24f6404/files/zh-cn/glossary/bandwidth/index.md", "split": "train", "text": "它经常以多少比特每秒的形式来度量，例如兆比特每秒（Mbps）、吉比特每秒（Gbps）。", "title": "带宽"}
{"article_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Pixel", "attribution": "Mozilla Contributors", "doc_id": "mdn:en:glossary/pixel", "excerpt_sha256": "6771e562cac0ad376c5ecbdd36a6c734ac72e44da6bc2dc5fb80c08391f41bee", "family_id": "mdn:glossary/pixel", "language": "en", "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.5", "source_byte": [99, 358], "source_sha256": "eb31957fba34b16201c6df71a3bc2da491f6cd18e113267dbbc6bcc6235338a2", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdn/content/05b21c9303964f221febe77f053e5636f230afe9/files/en-us/glossary/pixel/index.md", "split": "train", "text": "A pixel is the smallest building block of a graphical display like a computer screen.\n\nDisplay resolution is expressed in the unit of pixels. For example, a \"800 x 600\" pixel resolution means that 800 pixels can be displayed in width and 600 pixels in height.", "title": "Pixel"}
{"article_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Glossary/Pixel", "attribution": "Mozilla Contributors", "doc_id": "mdn:zh:glossary/pixel", "excerpt_sha256": "e39937f70787ee67dddcafe19bfa287b6b2c45ae7a6f3355ba1012b4af09f82b", "family_id": "mdn:glossary/pixel", "language": "zh", "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.5", "source_byte": [107, 332], "source_sha256": "4891a7db8917d0381a911d8dfe94cb9d2831fb09580a80ba69e6877f6b0f9d7c", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdn/translated-content/79c5df5882bc51786844b8fa72a06a80a24f6404/files/zh-cn/glossary/pixel/index.md", "split": "train", "text": "像素是图形显示（如计算机屏幕）的最小构建块。\n\n显示分辨率用像素单位表示。例如，“800 x 600”像素分辨率意味着横向可以显示 800 个像素，纵向可以显示 600 个像素。", "title": "像素"}
{"article_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Viewport", "attribution": "Mozilla Contributors", "doc_id": "mdn:en:glossary/viewport", "excerpt_sha256": "da0f71a63b5819d094499341220747abd2067b7b30ad99617f68b49543af01fe", "family_id": "mdn:glossary/viewport", "language": "en", "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.5", "source_byte": [226, 509], "source_sha256": "4bd781892752712f6679a80d5aed96b39b6d70a7e2107dd6ee356a218b71dc12", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdn/content/05b21c9303964f221febe77f053e5636f230afe9/files/en-us/glossary/viewport/index.md", "split": "train", "text": "In web browser terms, it refers to the part of the document being viewed in the browser window (or on-screen, if the document is being viewed on a mobile browser or a desktop browser in full-screen mode). Content outside the viewport is not visible onscreen until scrolled into view.", "title": "Viewport"}
{"article_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Glossary/Viewport", "attribution": "Mozilla Contributors", "doc_id": "mdn:zh:glossary/viewport", "excerpt_sha256": "f93296943dbedc4105ea1d213bbd77244e7f7de2ed990bdb0dccd6aee5ebc61e", "family_id": "mdn:glossary/viewport", "language": "zh", "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.5", "source_byte": [221, 478], "source_sha256": "59e3fc8ef711f9832c86b35683712d7efabfa21a86498e98c6d62cb39948b5b0", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdn/translated-content/79c5df5882bc51786844b8fa72a06a80a24f6404/files/zh-cn/glossary/viewport/index.md", "split": "train", "text": "在 Web 浏览器范畴里，它指的是在浏览器窗口中（或者如果文档是在移动浏览器或桌面浏览器的全屏模式下查看，则指的是屏幕上）查看的文档部分。视口外的内容在被滚动进来前都是不可见的。", "title": "视口"}
{"article_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Latency", "attribution": "Mozilla Contributors", "doc_id": "mdn:en:glossary/latency", "excerpt_sha256": "f9dc45c36bd42778d526f63323d9b03c4c554376c6f51abdfd18cd233ca2a2a9", "family_id": "mdn:glossary/latency", "language": "en", "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.5", "source_byte": [195, 355], "source_sha256": "aeeb4269beb4f021e7e29f33c91a5f7e01a3b2c67f1ca5922e8a3e95b4902b01", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdn/content/05b21c9303964f221febe77f053e5636f230afe9/files/en-us/glossary/latency/index.md", "split": "dev", "text": "Low latency is good, meaning there is little or no delay. High latency is bad, meaning it takes a long time for the requested resource to reach its destination.", "title": "Latency"}
{"article_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Glossary/Latency", "attribution": "Mozilla Contributors", "doc_id": "mdn:zh:glossary/latency", "excerpt_sha256": "af0b740064f2ea7fcbfc321b4d7d039bc5808e4c2e7857bf68ca837be5b2a726", "family_id": "mdn:glossary/latency", "language": "zh", "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.5", "source_byte": [182, 326], "source_sha256": "f5bf40ac4380e9846aacd902d80a98940f36af75e1ffe7a45546410962fadb30", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdn/translated-content/79c5df5882bc51786844b8fa72a06a80a24f6404/files/zh-cn/glossary/latency/index.md", "split": "dev", "text": "低延迟是好事，意味着几乎没有延迟。高延迟是不好的，意味着所请求的资源要花很长时间才能到达目的地。", "title": "延迟"}
{"article_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Lossless_compression", "attribution": "Mozilla Contributors", "doc_id": "mdn:en:glossary/lossless_compression", "excerpt_sha256": "be9b42d6e9b54cd8050765b3e8b2f1742424e9eada610349465f6c399144b842", "family_id": "mdn:glossary/lossless_compression", "language": "en", "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.5", "source_byte": [282, 326], "source_sha256": "9a35e9aabb30d45aeaa70d39bbdd84fae5f1dee71e228941441243d4f9e0fd1e", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdn/content/05b21c9303964f221febe77f053e5636f230afe9/files/en-us/glossary/lossless_compression/index.md", "split": "test", "text": "Lossless compression methods are reversible.", "title": "Lossless compression"}
{"article_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Glossary/Lossless_compression", "attribution": "Mozilla Contributors", "doc_id": "mdn:zh:glossary/lossless_compression", "excerpt_sha256": "5089e49bb4d3815ff1fd7d90921c9fcdd1c8eb72f01241e5738ea0c1fbedad67", "family_id": "mdn:glossary/lossless_compression", "language": "zh", "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.5", "source_byte": [225, 258], "source_sha256": "4147f59eef1621282d8f1d57fa3704f5cb0632c4c2b62f2d32d6c3f2ab1a396c", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdn/translated-content/79c5df5882bc51786844b8fa72a06a80a24f6404/files/zh-cn/glossary/lossless_compression/index.md", "split": "test", "text": "无损压缩方法是可逆的。", "title": "无损压缩"}
{"article_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Lossy_compression", "attribution": "Mozilla Contributors", "doc_id": "mdn:en:glossary/lossy_compression", "excerpt_sha256": "c06cb25b3624309450955a393c6d167104b992edf5a6c256e42bb599b6b9df13", "family_id": "mdn:glossary/lossy_compression", "language": "en", "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.5", "source_byte": [287, 666], "source_sha256": "73cd77221acd14b95fee59371366ce2aa3c538e8f8d0cace9203298785077b9b", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdn/content/05b21c9303964f221febe77f053e5636f230afe9/files/en-us/glossary/lossy_compression/index.md", "split": "test", "text": "In simpler terms: lossy compression causes data from the initial file to be lost, possibly causing degradation in quality. The process of such compression is irreversible; once lossy compression of the content has been performed, the content cannot be restored to its original state. Therefore, content that has undergone lossy compression should generally not be further edited.", "title": "Lossy compression"}
{"article_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Glossary/Lossy_compression", "attribution": "Mozilla Contributors", "doc_id": "mdn:zh:glossary/lossy_compression", "excerpt_sha256": "08675884c83fa2fb492c3946fa609fc2c01b27f57dc4cca6e04127c74a47afd4", "family_id": "mdn:glossary/lossy_compression", "language": "zh", "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.5", "source_byte": [270, 549], "source_sha256": "b9a883927320986db0826b16e4b6dce1a730b790bb57507df63426dec0ed54a9", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdn/translated-content/79c5df5882bc51786844b8fa72a06a80a24f6404/files/zh-cn/glossary/lossy_compression/index.md", "split": "test", "text": "简单来说：有损压缩导致原始文件中的数据丢失，可能导致质量下降。这种压缩过程是不可逆的；一旦对内容进行了有损压缩，就无法将内容恢复到原始状态。因此，经过有损压缩的内容通常不应再进一步编辑。", "title": "有损压缩"}
